{'symbol': 'TROW', 'date': '2021-10-11 09:00:00', 'title': 'T. ROWE PRICE NAMES THERESA MCLAUGHLIN AS HEAD OF GLOBAL MARKETING', 'text': 'BALTIMORE, OCT. 11, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0T. ROWE PRICE GROUP (NASDAQ-GS: TROW) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THERESA MCLAUGHLIN, A RECOGNIZED MARKETING LEADER WITH MORE THAN 25 YEARS OF FINANCIAL INDUSTRY EXPERIENCE, WILL JOIN THE FIRM ON OCTOBER 25, 2021, AS HEAD OF GLOBAL MARKETING.'}